        <mxCell id="LARGE_SPHERE_STEP" value="&lt;b&gt;Apply a proportional sphere step with a progressive cap&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;p = clamp(0.4 + 0.5q − (0.2 if precise; otherwise 0) + m)&lt;br&gt;Large-change pull = clamp((p + 0.2) × q)&lt;br&gt;Cap = min(1.5 D, ordinary step + max(0, gap − 1.25 D) × 1)&lt;br&gt;Ordinary step: 0.50 D if age &amp;lt;40 or not precise; otherwise 0.25 D&lt;br&gt;Either |S| ≥6 D → cap 0.25 D; never overshoot measured S&lt;br&gt;Step = min(gap, cap, rounded gap × pull); round final S to 0.25 D" ruleIds="W9_LARGE_SPHERE" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e3f0fc;strokeColor=#47749c;strokeWidth=2.5;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=18;fontFamily=Arial;fontColor=#172635;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
